  <article class="sheet letter">
    <h1>Coach</h1>
    <p>Coach is one-to-one feedback on a sermon manuscript. The same kind of attention the Hall gives a well-known preacher — how the sermon moves, and where the text is doing its work — comes back as private notes for your growth.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><span class="n">1</span><span>You send a manuscript.</span></li>
      <li><span class="n">2</span><span>We read the moves: opening the text, pressing a truth, turning toward the people in the room.</span></li>
      <li><span class="n">3</span><span>You get notes written back to you, for the next sermon.</span></li>
    </ol>
    <p>There is no upload on this page. If you want notes on a manuscript, write <a href="mailto:chris@sovgracekc.org?subject=Coach">Chris Oswald</a> and say it is for Coach.</p>
